    "title": "Is Bill Murray rooting for UConn in March Madness?",
    "text": "NCAABIs Bill Murray rooting for UConn in March Madness?Wajih AlBaroudiFor The WinMarch 20, 2026, 2:02 p.m. ETKeep WatchingBill Murray is a hard person to track down.The legendary actor famously does not have an agent nor a publicist, so he uses a 1-800 number and voicemail system to hear from friends and colleagues.So, if you don't have that number, the next best spot to meet Murray might be a UConn men's basketball game. Why, you may ask? You've come to the right place.Is Bill Murray a UConn fan?By association, yes!Murray's son, Luke Murray, has been an assistant coach under Dan Hurley since 2021, winning consecutive championships in 2023 and '24. Bill, 75, has regularly attended games during that time and even celebrated on court with the Huskies' after their national title wins.So, it would not be surprising at all to see Bill cheering on the Huskies as March Madness continues. We'll be on the lookout.This Hypnotic Hummingbird Windmill Is MesmerizingEsslyn | SponsoredSponsoredLearn MoreUndoThe Crude Oil Rally Is Reshaping Defensive Stock StrategiesDefensive trading now includes crude exposure. Two ‘Strong Buy’ names stand out.Seeking Alpha | SponsoredSponsoredRead MoreUndoYour Refund is Calling! IRS E-File is OpenTurboTax | SponsoredSponsoredLearn MoreUndoWho Has The Cheapest Car Insurance in Virginia? (Check Zip Code)Tired of high car insurance rates? Read this before paying your next bill.Car Insurance Offers | SponsoredSponsoredLearn MoreUndoSee where your glucose has been and where it’s headed.With Dexcom G7 15 Day, you’ll see your glucose in real time. It even shows if you’re trending high or going low, so you can make more confident decisions today for healthier tomorrows. Click for data and safety information.Dexcom | SponsoredSponsoredUndoThese Are The \"Rolex\" Of Hearing Aids (And Under $100)Exceptional hearing technology without the hefty cost, backed by expertsSoundbright Magazine | SponsoredSponsoredUndoBrain Fog Has Been Linked To A Com